          In a 6-month trial across 11 hospitals (Lei et al., 2026, 337 adults), this trial did not find a statistically significant reduction in visceral fat or liver fat compared with placebo, while confirming modest secondary lipid improvements.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-[#f0ede9]">
          <a href="/weight-loss/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#0075de] hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 group">
